'''Parade of the Dead (Deadly)''' is the first stage in [[The Dead & The Bloated]]. After clearing this [[No Continues]] stage, the player can challenge the [[Continuation Stage]] [[Puffer Planet (Merciless) (Dead & Bloated)|Puffer Planet (Merciless)]].

