==Strategy==
Puffsley's stage is a lot harder than Daboo's, so you should be focusing your lineup to deal with the continuation stage instead of this one. Having [[Ramen Cat]], [[Shigong Cat]], and [[Can Can Cat]] is basically a free win.

===Recommended Ubers===
*[[Lesser Demon Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Greater Balrog Cat]]: Balrog, at a high enough level and with enough [[Talents]], can solo Parade of the Dead, while also dealing huge damage to [[Puffsley's Comet]] in [[Puffer Planet (Merciless) (Dead & Bloated)|Puffer Planet]]
*[[Bliza (Uber Rare Cat)|Blizarena]]: Since both of the stages are focused around Alien and Zombie enemies Bliza can serve as an effective tank.
*[[Ganglion (Uber Rare Cat)|Ganglion the Unleashed]]: Works extremely well in Puffsley's Comet's stage, and is strong against Zombies so he isn't too bad against Daboo's stage either.

